    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "388280b19a893f38",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Gemma？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51fc0d7e52427fa1",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 是 Google 基于 Gemini 推出的一个系列，包含 4 个全新的大语言模型（LLM）。它有两种参数规模：2B 和 7B，每种规模都有基础（预训练）版本和指令微调版本。所有变体即使不经过量化，也能在各种类型的消费级硬件上运行，并且上下文长度为 8K 个 token：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90ceda02f5450a03",
      "translationZh": "gemma-7b：基础 7B 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bc6c6b49b2e73bc4",
      "translationZh": "gemma-7b-it：基础 7B 模型的指令微调版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0fc08db16da742f9",
      "translationZh": "gemma-2b：基础 2B 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9132d4202d4b7b5",
      "translationZh": "gemma-2b-it：基础 2B 模型的指令微调版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5d8d1902ef47a21",
      "translationZh": "最初发布一个月后，Google 发布了新版指令模型。这一版本在编程能力、事实准确性、指令遵循和多轮交互质量方面都有提升。该模型也更少以“Sure,”开头。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d71f415f3495c5bf",
      "translationZh": "那么，Gemma 模型究竟有多好？下面概述了这些基础模型及其在 LLM Leaderboard 上与其他开放模型相比的表现（分数越高越好）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c011d6097bfbc8e9",
      "translationZh": "许可证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "773d36e3dea87d49",
      "translationZh": "可商用？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7a32ae095768942",
      "translationZh": "预训练规模 [tokens]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
