    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b23a6a8439c0dde5",
      "translationZh": "未知",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5dcffe836b6ec8a",
      "translationZh": "麻省理工学院",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b23a6a8439c0dde5",
      "translationZh": "未知",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6960228bac5a04f2",
      "translationZh": "Llama 2 许可证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fca8564849fe2efa",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 许可证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5dfd52fa8036be3",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 7B 是一个非常强大的模型，其性能可与 7B 量级中最优秀的模型相媲美，包括 Mistral 7B。就其规模而言，Gemma 2B 是一个值得关注的模型，但它在排行榜上的得分不及类似规模中能力最强的模型，例如 Phi 2。我们期待收到社区关于实际使用情况的反馈！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "193d185f13884567",
      "translationZh": "请记住，LLM Leaderboard 尤其适合衡量预训练模型的质量，而不太适合衡量聊天模型的质量。对于聊天模型，我们建议运行其他基准测试，例如 MT Bench、EQ Bench 和 lmsys Arena！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e283de02e19f9df0",
      "translationZh": "提示词格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79c9426fc39a16de",
      "translationZh": "基础模型没有提示词格式。与其他基础模型一样，它们可用于为输入序列生成合理的后续内容，或进行零样本／少样本推理。它们也是针对你自己的用例进行微调的良好基础。Instruct 版本的对话结构非常简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4cbb46add46f0d3",
      "translationZh": "要有效使用模型，就必须严格复现这一格式。稍后我们将展示，借助 transformers 中提供的聊天模板，复现 instruct 提示词有多么容易。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "315e50f2fa80d790",
      "translationZh": "探索未知",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96519d0950eb00fc",
      "translationZh": "技术报告包含有关基础模型训练和评估过程的信息，但没有详细介绍数据集的组成和预处理。我们知道，它们使用了来自多种来源的数据进行训练，主要是网页文档、代码和数学文本。这些数据经过过滤，以移除 CSAM 内容和 PII，并进行了许可检查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e86e30b2b1244ac",
      "translationZh": "同样，对于 Gemma 指令模型，也未公布有关微调数据集或 SFT 和 RLHF 相关超参数的任何细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a2cc0673b1c4283",
      "translationZh": "演示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "330917a3d3195a6b",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Hugging Chat 上与 Gemma Instruct 模型聊天！点击此处链接体验：https://huggingface.co/chat/models/google/gemma-1.1-7b-it",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "74986d675900999d",
      "translationZh": "使用 🤗 Transformers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5fa05cd2bf192ef",
      "translationZh": "借助 Transformers 4.38 版本，你可以使用 Gemma，并利用 Hugging Face 生态系统中的所有工具，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce8cfcdc9e839a21",
      "translationZh": "训练和推理脚本及示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed89844584690c08",
      "translationZh": "安全文件格式（safetensors）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c1cbffbd35e572a",
      "translationZh": "与 bitsandbytes（4 位量化）、PEFT（参数高效微调）和 Flash Attention 2 等工具的集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a327c4a3bb24935",
      "translationZh": "用于通过模型执行生成任务的实用工具和辅助工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35bdf50d18bf2e52",
      "translationZh": "用于导出模型以进行部署的机制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e4f831499369d24",
      "translationZh": "此外，Gemma 模型兼容启用 CUDA graphs 的 torch.compile()，可在推理时获得约 4 倍的速度提升！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "270a3d801a20b7fe",
      "translationZh": "要通过 transformers 使用 Gemma 模型，请确保安装较新版本的 transformers：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ecb18109d2424ce",
      "translationZh": "以下片段展示了如何通过 transformers 使用 gemma-7b-it。它需要约 18 GB 的 RAM，3090 或 4090 等消费级 GPU 也能满足这一要求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ffdc400c17d6db5",
      "translationZh": "嘿，我的好伙计。我是驰骋公海的海盗，随时准备劫掠一番。准备好听一个关于冒险与宝藏的故事吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "424bea59a0f3d201",
      "translationZh": "我们使用了 bfloat16，因为它是参考精度，所有评估也都是以这一精度进行的。在你的硬件上，以 float16 运行可能会更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3503015aca52e06",
      "translationZh": "你也可以自动量化模型，以 8-bit 甚至 4-bit 模式加载。以 4-bit 加载后运行大约需要 9 GB 内存，因此许多消费级显卡以及 Google Colab 中的所有 GPU 都能运行它。以下是以 4-bit 加载生成流水线的方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17e53262a86aa15a",
      "translationZh": "有关使用 transformers 运行这些模型的更多详情，请查看模型卡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "160b38fc4a032fa6",
      "translationZh": "JAX 权重",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e79a44f607502dea",
      "translationZh": "如上文所述，所有 Gemma 模型变体均可搭配 PyTorch 使用，也可搭配 JAX / Flax 使用。要加载 Flax 权重，你需要使用仓库中的 flax 修订版本，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73de4101de24c0a1",
      "translationZh": "['瓦伦西亚和马拉加是西班牙最受欢迎的旅游目的地之二。这两座城市都拥有悠久的历史、充满活力的文化，']",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f25d95291013eac",
      "translationZh": "请查看这个 notebook，获取关于如何在 Colab TPUs 上并行执行 JAX 推理的全面实操指南！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d6114c5fa16d561d",
      "translationZh": "与 Google Cloud 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05a75d6b2afdb6db",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用 Text Generation Inference 和 Transformers，通过 Vertex AI 或 Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE) 在 Google Cloud 上部署和训练 Gemma。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a4fbc117b8d1930",
      "translationZh": "要部署 Hugging Face 上的 Gemma 模型，请前往模型页面并点击 Deploy -> Google Cloud。这会将你带到 Google Cloud Console，你可以在那里一键将 Gemma 部署到 Vertex AI 或 GKE。Text Generation Inference 为 Google Cloud 上的 Gemma 提供支持，也是我们与 Google Cloud 合作中的首项集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e73f0f252113eb1",
      "translationZh": "你也可以直接通过 Vertex AI Model Garden 访问 Gemma。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3145e87a6db79e9",
      "translationZh": "要对 Hugging Face 上的 Gemma 模型进行调优，请前往模型页面并点击 Train -> Google Cloud。这会将你带到 Google Cloud Console，你可以在那里访问笔记本，在 Vertex AI 或 GKE 上对 Gemma 进行调优。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "486edce6360a0994",
      "translationZh": "这些集成是我们与 Google 建立合作伙伴关系后共同推出的首批产品与服务。敬请期待更多内容！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "589193c6737c9d9c",
      "translationZh": "与 Inference Endpoints 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de857862c32265b8",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Hugging Face 的 Inference Endpoints 上部署 Gemma，它使用 Text Generation Inference 作为后端。Text Generation Inference 是由 Hugging Face 开发的生产就绪推理容器，旨在让大语言模型的部署变得简单。它具备连续批处理、词元流式传输、用于在多个 GPU 上进行快速推理的张量并行，以及生产就绪的日志记录和追踪等功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfded4d8f02b74f0",
      "translationZh": "要部署 Gemma 模型，请前往模型页面并点击 Deploy -> Inference Endpoints 控件。你可以在之前的一篇博客文章中进一步了解如何使用 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 部署大语言模型。Inference Endpoints 通过 Text Generation Inference 支持 Messages API，因此只需更改 URL，你就可以从另一个闭源模型切换到开放模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "176de3c46bbd93ab",
      "translationZh": "使用 🤗 TRL 进行微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee8d6e11c2df9a9c",
      "translationZh": "训练大语言模型在技术和计算方面都可能颇具挑战。在本节中，我们将介绍 Hugging Face 生态系统中可用的工具，以便在消费级 GPU 上高效训练 Gemma。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7163c1824699be09",
      "translationZh": "下方提供了一个在 OpenAssistant 聊天数据集上微调 Gemma 的示例命令。我们使用 4-bit 量化和 QLoRA 来节省显存，以便对所有注意力模块中的线性层进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69d568ddd6c6538f",
      "translationZh": "首先，安装 🤗 TRL 的每夜构建版本，并克隆代码仓库以获取训练脚本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6790d9a9a02fd23",
      "translationZh": "然后就可以运行脚本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ecf9b0b079c0dcd",
      "translationZh": "在单张 A10G 上训练大约需要 9 小时，但只需将 --num_processes 调整为可用 GPU 的数量，就能轻松实现并行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9459e12f91695e9b",
      "translationZh": "更多资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c86a0119d5e288ef",
      "translationZh": "Hub 上的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
